</style></head><body><header class="app-top"><div class="brand"><div class="brand-symbol" aria-hidden="true">✦</div><span>Stockwise</span></div><div class="top-label">Portfolio demo · Local-first</div></header><div class="hero"><p class="hero-eyebrow">Warehouse console</p><h1><span>Inventory that stays ahead.</span></h1><p class="hero-copy">Explore the Stockwise workspace. Built around practical workflows, clear decisions, and fast everyday tasks.</p><div class="feature-pills"><span>Stock levels</span><span>movements</span><span>reorder signals</span></div></div><h1>{{ config('app.name') }}</h1><p><small>@yield('subtitle')</small></p>
